\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 Ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang9  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang9  1\par
1 s\f1\lang1066\u7889? kh\f0\lang1033\'e1i ni\f1\lang1066\u7879?m\par
B\f0\lang1033\'e3i r\'e1c l\'e0 c\f2\u417? s\f1\lang1066\u7903? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i, n\f2\u417?i ch\f1\u7845?t th\u7843?i \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893? xu\u7889?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\f1\lang1066\u7911? l\u7899?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f1\lang1066\u7895?i ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y\par
Nguy\'ean t\f1\lang1066\u7855?c 3R trong qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c \f2\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'e0 Gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?m thi\u7871?u, t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871?\par
\ldblquote Vi\u7879?c ch\u7871? bi\u7871?n l\u7841?i m\u7897?t s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m theo m\u7897?t ch\u7913?c n\f2\'e3ng m\f1\u7899?i, m\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'edch m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i\rdblquote  \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c g\u7885?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? ch\u7845?t th\u7843?i.\par
Nh\u7919?ng ch\u7845?t th\u7843?i d\u7877? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n h\f1\lang1066\u7911?y g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3 gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?y, v\u7853?t ch\u7845?t nh\f0\lang1033\'f4m, b\'f4ng c\'f2n kh\'f3 ph\'e2n h\f1\lang1066\u7911?y c\f0\lang1033\'f3 gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?y nh\f0\lang1033\'f4m\par
\ldblquote Vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng m\u7897?t s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m nhi\u7873?u l\u7847?n cho \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n h\u7871?t tu\u7893?i th\u7885? s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m ho\u7863?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 v\f1\lang1066\u7899?i m\u7897?t ch\u7913?c n\f2\'e3ng m\f1\u7899?i, m\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'edch m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i\rdblquote  \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c g\u7885?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng.\par
Chai-h\u7897?p nh\u7921?a, Ion-h\u7897?p kim lo\u7841?i, v\u7887? h\u7897?p s\u7919?a, gi\u7845?y l\f0\lang1033\'e0 r\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? (theo UEH Go Green Station)\par
\par
C\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng\par
1.T\u7915? ch\u7889?i s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7853?t d\u7909?ng k\f0\lang1033\'e8m theo (t\'fai nilon, \f1\lang1066\u7889?ng h\f0\lang1033\'fat nh\f1\lang1066\u7921?a, \f2\'f0\f1\u7891? khuy\u7871?n m\f0\lang1033\'e3i,...) khi kh\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n thi\u7871?t\par
2. \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? nh\u7857?m h\u7841?n ch\u7871?, ng\f2\'e3n ch\f1\u7863?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi x\f1\lang1066\u7843? th\u7843?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\f0\'fang quy \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh, tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng \f2\'d0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c UEH \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 L\f1\lang1066\u7855?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7863?t camera quan s\f0\lang1033\'e1t t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c Tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i UEH (UEH Go Green Station)\par
3. C\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e1ch \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd t\f1\lang1066\u7889?i \f2\u432?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a hi\u7879?n nay \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n ch\'e3n nu\f0\lang1033\'f4i, s\f1\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\'f3n h\f1\lang1066\u7919?u c\f2\u417?, ch\f1\u7845?t t\u7849?y r\u7917?a sinh h\u7885?c, h\u7847?m \u7911? kh\f0\lang1033\'ed sinh h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c t\u7841?o n\f2\'e3ng l\u432?\f1\u7907?ng, \u7911? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n,...\par
4. C\'e1c c\'e1ch t\f1\lang1066\u7889?i \f2\u432?u \'f0\f1\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd r\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3:\par
\f3\bullet  B\f1\lang1066\u7843?n cho b\f0\lang1033\'ean thu mua ve chai nh\f2\u432?: VECA, Ve chai ch\f0\'fa Ho\f1\lang1066\u7843?, c\f0\lang1033\'f4 ch\'fa thu mua nh\f1\lang1066\u7887? l\u7867?,...\par
\f3\bullet  G\f1\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'e0 m\'e1y t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? nh\f2\u432?: Nh\f1\u7921?a Duy T\f0\lang1033\'e2n, M\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng \f0\lang1033\'c1 Ch\'e2u, PLASTICPeople, RecycleOne...\par
\f3\bullet  G\f1\lang1066\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c, s\u7921? ki\u7879?n thu gom r\f0\lang1033\'e1c: Chu\f1\lang1066\u7895?i s\u7921? ki\u7879?n Green Day UEH, GreenPoints, Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 Nhi\f1\lang1066\u7873?u L\f0\lang1033\'e1, s\f1\lang1066\u7921? ki\u7879?n L\u7841?i \f2\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e2y Refill,....\par
5. C\'e1c h\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng m\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f1\lang1066\u7895?i UEHers c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? ti\u7871?t ki\u7879?m t\f0\lang1033\'e0i nguy\'ean l\'e0: t\f1\lang1066\u7855?t m\f0\lang1033\'e1y l\f1\lang1066\u7841?nh v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7879?n ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c khi kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\'f3 nhu c\f1\lang1066\u7847?u s\u7917? d\u7909?ng; l\u7845?y n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c u\u7889?ng v\u7915?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7911?, kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? b\u7883? tr\f0\lang1033\'e0n ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893? \f2\'f0i l\f0\lang1033\'e3ng ph\'ed v\'e0 r\f1\lang1066\u7917?a tay v\u7899?i l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c v\u7915?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7911?\par
6. C\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng m\f0\lang1033\'e0 UEHers c\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? ti\u7871?t ki\u7879?m gi\u7845?y l\f0\lang1033\'e0: ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?t ki\u7879?m gi\u7845?y in v\f2\'e3n ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng; s\f1\lang1066\u7889? ho\f0\lang1033\'e1 c\'e1c v\f2\'e3n b\f1\lang1066\u7843?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7863?ng s\f0\lang1033\'e1ch/ t\'e0i li\f1\lang1066\u7879?u cho ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c khi c\'f2n d\'f9ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c.\par
7. \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u m\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c UEHer, c\'e1 nh\'e2n ra v\'e0o UEH b\f1\lang1066\u7855?t bu\u7897?c ph\u7843?i th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng h\u7885?c, \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u ki\u7879?n h\u7885?c t\u7853?p t\u7841?i tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7919? v\u7879? sinh kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c thu\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng; b\u7843?o v\u7879?, g\f0\lang1033\'ecn gi\f1\lang1066\u7919? c\f2\u417? s\f1\u7903? v\u7853?t ch\u7845?t, trang thi\u7871?t b\u7883? t\u7841?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c kh\'f4ng gian, khu\'f4n vi\'ean UEH; b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879?, ch\f2\'e3m s\f0\lang1033\'f3c c\'e2y xanh t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i khu\f0\lang1033\'f4n vi\'ean c\'e1c c\f2\u417? s\f1\lang1066\u7903?\par
8. \f2\'d0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m b\u7843?o ngu\u7891?n r\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? ch\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\f2\u417? s\f1\lang1066\u7903? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871?, UEHer v\f0\lang1033\'e0 kh\'e1ch ra v\'e0o khu\'f4n vi\'ean tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng UEH b\u7855?t bu\u7897?c ph\u7843?i th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i ngu\u7891?n.\par
9. \f2\'d0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? hi\u7875?u th\f0\lang1033\'eam v\f1\lang1066\u7873? c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, sinh vi\f0\lang1033\'ean UEH \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng tham gia c\f0\lang1033\'e1c s\f1\lang1066\u7921? ki\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? l\u7845?y qu\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i UEH\par
10. \f2\'d0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? h\u7895? tr\u7907? UEHers th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\u7841?i ngu\u7891?n, nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ra \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng nh\u7853?n di\u7879?n r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i b\u7857?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f1\lang1066\u7879? Al, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c b\f1\lang1066\u7841?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng nh\u7919?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7909? n\f0\lang1033\'e0y t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ngu\f1\lang1066\u7891?n sau: APP UEH Students, APP UEHers v\f0\lang1033\'e0 Website UEH Green Campus ({{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://gogreen.ueh.edu.vn }}{\fldrslt{https://gogreen.ueh.edu.vn\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
11. \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? t\f2\'e3ng c\u432?\f1\u7901?ng th\u7875? ch\u7845?t, UEHer \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch gia t\f2\'e3ng t\f1\lang1066\u7889?i \f2\'f0a vi\f1\u7879?c v\u7853?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng th\u7875? ch\u7845?t, khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng thang b\u7897? trong khu\f0\lang1033\'f4n vi\'ean c\'e1c c\f2\u417? s\f1\lang1066\u7903? \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i c\u7921? ly ph\f0\lang1033\'f9 h\f1\lang1066\u7907?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? t\f2\'e3ng c\u432?\f1\u7901?ng th\u7875? ch\u7845?t.\par
12. \f2\'d0\f1\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, UEHers c\u7847?n c\f0\lang1033\'e2n nh\f1\lang1066\u7855?c th\u7853?t k\u7929? tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c khi mua v\u7853?t d\u7909?ng m\u7899?i, \f2\'f0\f1\u7863?c bi\u7879?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7907?t khuy\u7871?n m\f0\lang1033\'e3i, si\'eau gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?m gi\f0\lang1033\'e1\par
13. UEHers \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch gia t\f2\'e3ng c\f0\'e2y xanh t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i b\f0\lang1033\'e0n l\'e0m vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c, v\f2\'e3n ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng l\'e0m vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c, ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng \f1\lang1066\u7903? (\f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i k\f0\lang1033\'fd t\'fac x\'e1 sinh vi\'ean)\f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? gi\f0\lang1033\'fap kh\'f4ng gian th\'eam xanh v\'e0 trong l\'e0nh\par
14. \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7875? h\u7841?n ch\u7871? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, khi \f2\'f0i h\f1\u7885?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0i l\f0\'e0m, c\'e1c UEHer \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch mang c\'e1c b\f1\lang1066\u7919?a c\f2\u417?m t\f1\u7921? n\u7845?u \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i\par
15. \u7902? Vi\u7879?t Nam, trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh m\f1\lang1066\u7895?i m\u7897?t ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i d\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ra 41kg r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7921?a m\u7895?i n\f2\'e3m, v\f1\u7853?y \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i th\f0\lang1033\'ec UEHer n\'ean:\par
\f3\bullet Trang b\f1\lang1066\u7883? t\f0\lang1033\'fai s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c nhi\u7873?u l\u7847?n khi \f2\'f0i mua s\f1\u7855?m (t\f0\lang1033\'fai v\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, t\f0\lang1033\'fai gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?y, t\f0\lang1033\'fai nh\f1\lang1066\u7921?a s\u7917? d\u7909?ng nhi\u7873?u l\u7847?n...);\par
\f3\bullet  S\f1\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i v\u7853?t d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng nhi\f1\lang1066\u7873?u l\u7847?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 kh\f1\lang1066\u7843? n\f2\'e3ng t\f0\lang1033\'e1i l\'e0m \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?y nh\f2\u432? b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c, ly n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c UEH \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? h\u7841?n ch\u7871? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7921?a m\u7897?t l\u7847?n\par
\f3\bullet  T\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng t\u7889?i \f2\'f0a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i h\u7897?p, chai, t\f0\lang1033\'fai \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng\par
16. UEHer \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 bao b\'ec \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? k\f0\lang1033\'e9o d\'e0i v\'f2ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7901?i s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m, nh\f2\u432?ng v\f1\u7851?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m b\u7843?o an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n s\f1\lang1066\u7913?c kh\u7887?e.\par
17. UEHer, c\f0\lang1033\'e1 nh\'e2n ra v\'e0o UEH b\f1\lang1066\u7855?t bu\u7897?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n b\f0\lang1033\'f3c t\'e1ch, ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c khi x\f1\lang1066\u7843? th\u7843?i.\par
18. Vi\u7879?c b\u7841?n gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u s\u7889? l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng tr\f0\lang1033\'ean 1 lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m n\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 v\'e0 \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u n\f0\lang1033\'e0y th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n b\u7857?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch b\f1\lang1066\u7841?n s\u7869? c\f0\lang1033\'e2n nh\f1\lang1066\u7855?c k\u7929? khi \f2\'f0i mua h\f0\lang1033\'e0ng hay khi s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1c s\f1\lang1066\u7843?n ph\u7849?m \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c g\u7885?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 Reduce (Ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?t gi\u7843?m)\par
Nh\u7919?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u c\u7847?n bi\u7871?t\par
1.C\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e1ch \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd t\f1\lang1066\u7889?i \f2\u432?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a hi\u7879?n nay \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n ch\'e3n nu\f0\lang1033\'f4i, s\f1\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\'f3n h\f1\lang1066\u7919?u c\f2\u417?, ch\f1\u7845?t t\u7849?y r\u7917?a sinh h\u7885?c, h\u7847?m \u7911? kh\f0\lang1033\'ed sinh h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c t\u7841?o n\f2\'e3ng l\u432?\f1\u7907?ng, \u7911? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n,...\par
2. C\'e1c c\'e1ch t\f1\lang1066\u7889?i \f2\u432?u \'f0\f1\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd r\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3:\par
\f3\bullet  B\f0\'e1n cho b\'ean thu mua ve chai nh\f2\u432?: VECA, Ve chai ch\f0\'fa Ho\f1\lang1066\u7843?, c\f0\lang1033\'f4 ch\'fa thu mua nh\f1\lang1066\u7887? l\u7867?,..\par
\f3\bullet  G\f1\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'e0 m\'e1y t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? nh\f2\u432?: Nh\f1\u7921?a Duy T\f0\lang1033\'e2n, M\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng \f0\lang1033\'c1 Ch\'e2u, PLASTICPeople, RecycleOne...\par
\f3\bullet  G\f1\lang1066\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c, s\u7921? ki\u7879?n thu gom r\f0\lang1033\'e1c: Chu\f1\lang1066\u7895?i s\u7921? ki\u7879?n Green Day UEH, GreenPoints, Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 Nhi\f1\lang1066\u7873?u L\f0\lang1033\'e1, s\f1\lang1066\u7921? ki\u7879?n L\u7841?i \f2\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e2y Refill,....\par
3. Chai nh\f1\lang1066\u7921?a (PET) trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh m\f1\lang1066\u7845?t t\u7915? 450 \f3\endash  1000 n\f2\'e3m \'f0\f1\u7875? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n hu\f1\lang1066\u7927? - bi\u7871?n m\u7845?t ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n ngo\'e0i m\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng\par
4. Ch\u7845?t th\u7843?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng th\u7921?c v\u7853?t c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? chuy\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh kh\'ed sinh h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c\par
5. \f2\'d0\f1\u7863?c \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m c\u7911?a r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7901?i gian ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n hu\f1\lang1066\u7927? t\u7921? nhi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? r\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'e2u (l\'ean t\f1\lang1066\u7899?i tr\f2\'e3m ho\f1\u7863?c tri\u7879?u n\f2\'e3m) nh\u432?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? g\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'e0 m\'e1y \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd v\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng l\u7841?i \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c.\par
6. \f2\'d0\f1\u7863?c \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m c\u7911?a r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7901?i gian ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n h\f1\lang1066\u7911?y nhanh (\f0\lang1033\'edt h\f2\u417?n 1 n\'e3m), \'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897? \u7849?m cao, kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng th\f1\lang1066\u7875? l\f2\u432?u tr\f1\u7919? l\f0\lang1033\'e2u v\'ec s\f1\lang1066\u7869? b\u7883? b\u7889?c m\f0\lang1033\'f9i h\'f4i th\f1\lang1066\u7889?i, b\u7883? n\u7845?m, thu h\f0\lang1033\'fat c\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i sinh v\u7853?t nh\f2\u432? ki\f1\u7871?n, ru\u7891?i, b\u7885?,....\par
7. M\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a vi\u7879?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\u7841?i ngu\u7891?n c\u7911?a tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng UEH \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 Gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?m vi\u7879?c th\u7843?i tr\u7921?c ti\u7871?p ra ngo\f0\lang1033\'e0i m\'f4i kim h\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?ng Ph\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m b\u7843?o ch\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng r\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?u v\f0\lang1033\'e0o cho \f2\'f0\u417?n v\f1\lang1066\u7883? \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? c\u7911?a UEH.\par
Nh\u7919?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u c\u7847?n bi\u7871?t\par
8. Th\u7913? t\u7921? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e1ch \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i thu\u7927? tinh g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3\par
[1] Tr\'e1nh mua \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7891? thu\u7927? tinh n\u7871?u kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'ecm \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c n\f2\u417?i x\f1\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd.\par
[2] Tr\f1\lang1066\u7843? l\u7841?i n\f2\u417?i mua, ho\f1\u7863?c s\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng.\par
[3] T\u7853?n d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m c\'e1c v\f1\lang1066\u7853?t trang tr\f0\lang1033\'ed ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7921?ng th\u7921?c ph\u7849?m t\u7841?i nh\f0\lang1033\'e0.\par
9. Ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i h\u7885?c vi ph\u7841?m c\f0\lang1033\'e1c quy \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh \f2\'d0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c xanh, t\f0\lang1033\'f9y v\'e0o m\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?, s\u7869? b\u7883?\par
\f0\lang1033\'b7X\f1\lang1066\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd t\f1\lang1066\u7915? nh\u7855?c nh\u7903? \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n k\u7927? lu\u7853?t t\u7889?i \f2\'f0a (m\f1\u7913?c c\u7843?nh c\f0\lang1033\'e1o)\par
\f3\bullet  Tr\f1\lang1066\u7915? \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m r\f0\lang1033\'e8n luy\f1\lang1066\u7879?n sinh vi\f0\lang1033\'ean\par
10. R\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a b\u7883? tr\u7897?n l\u7851?n c\f0\lang1033\'f9ng c\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c kh\'e1c trong m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t t\f0\lang1033\'fai nilong v\'e0 \f2\'f0em \'f0i ch\f0\'f4n l\f1\lang1066\u7845?p \u7903? b\f0\lang1033\'e3i s\f1\lang1066\u7869? g\f0\lang1033\'e2y\par
\'b7\'d4 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7877?m kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng kh\'ed do ph\'e1t sinh kh\'ed nh\'e0 k\'ednh (CO2 v\'e0 CH4) g\'e2y hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n t\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng n\f0\lang1033\'f3ng l\'ean to\'e0n c\f1\lang1066\u7847?u, g\f0\lang1033\'e2y m\'f9i h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c \f2\'f0\f0\'e1m ch\'e1y \'e2m \f1\lang1066\u7881? t\u7841?o ra nhi\u7873?u kh\f0\lang1033\'ed \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c.\par
\f3\bullet  \f0\lang1033\'d4 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7877?m n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c m\u7863?t, n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c ng\u7847?m do n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c r\u7881? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c ch\f1\lang1066\u7913?a nhi\u7873?u ch\u7845?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?c h\u7841?i.\f0\lang1033\par
\f3\bullet  \f0\'d4 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7877?m \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t \u7903? b\f0\lang1033\'e3i ch\'f4n l\f1\lang1066\u7845?p\par
11. Nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'fd qu\f1\lang1066\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i theo h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng l\u7921?a ch\u7885?n t\u7915? th\u7845?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n cao \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0: Ng\f2\'e3n ng\f1\lang1066\u7915?a - Gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u\f0\lang1033  - T\'e1i s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f3\endash  T\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? - Thu h\u7891?i\par
12. Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i UEH \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?n bi\u7871?t, b\f0\lang1033\'f3c t\'e1ch v\f1\lang1066\u7853?t th\u7843?i b\u7887? v\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f2\'f0\f0\'fang lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i th\f0\lang1033\'f9ng r\'e1c, \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7843?m b\u7843?o ch\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng r\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?u v\f0\lang1033\'e0o cho \f2\'f0\u417?n v\f1\lang1066\u7883? \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? c\u7911?a UEH, gi\u7843?m vi\u7879?c th\u7843?i tr\u7921?c ti\u7871?p ra ngo\f0\lang1033\'e0i m\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng\par
Nh\u7919?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u c\u7847?n bi\u7871?t\par
13. Pin thu\u7897?c r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i nguy h\u7841?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?c bi\u7879?t v\f0\lang1033\'ec:\par
\f3\bullet  V\f0\'ec m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t vi\f0\lang1033\'ean pin c\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? l\f0\lang1033\'e0m \'f4 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7877?m 500L n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c ho\u7863?c 1m3 \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t trong v\f0\lang1033\'f2ng 50 n\f2\'e3m\par
\f3\bullet  V\f0\'ec khi ch\'f4n l\f1\lang1066\u7845?p pin, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c kim lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i n\u7863?ng nh\f2\u432?: Ch\f0\lang1033\'ec, k\f1\lang1066\u7869?m, niken v\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7911?y ng\f0\lang1033\'e2n c\'f3 trong pin s\f1\lang1066\u7869? th\u7845?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7845?t, ngu\u7891?n n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c ng\u7847?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'e2y \'f4 nhi\f1\lang1066\u7877?m ngu\u7891?n n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c.\par
\f3\bullet  V\f0\lang1033\'ec l\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?ng th\u7911?y ng\f0\lang1033\'e2n (Hg) c\'f3 trong m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t vi\f0\lang1033\'ean pin l\'e0 r\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\u7899?n, n\u7871?u th\u7845?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0o ngu\f1\lang1066\u7891?n n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2m nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?p v\f0\lang1033\'e0o c\f2\u417? th\f1\lang1066\u7875? qua \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng \f2\'e3n u\f1\u7889?ng ho\u7863?c h\f0\lang1033\'edt th\f1\lang1066\u7903?, th\u7911?y ng\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7875? g\f0\lang1033\'e2y h\f1\lang1066\u7841?i n\f0\lang1033\'e3o, th\f1\lang1066\u7853?n, h\u7879? th\u7889?ng sinh s\u7843?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tim m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch...\par
14. Th\u7901?i gian trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? m\u7897?t chai thu\u7927? tinh c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n hu\f1\lang1066\u7927? ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n to\'e0n l\'e0 1 tri\f1\lang1066\u7879?u n\f2\'e3m\par
15. Th\f1\u7921?c ph\u7849?m th\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ph\u7849?m ch\f2\u432?a ho\f1\u7863?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 qua ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? bi\u7871?n, ch\u7845?t l\u7887?ng h\u7919?u c\f2\u417? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\f1\lang1066\u7863?n, r\f0\lang1033\'e1c s\'e2n v\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?n. V\u7853?y nh\u7919?ng lo\u7841?i sau \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e2y l\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ph\u7849?m th\u7915?a\par
\f3\bullet  V\f1\u7887? t\u7855?c/chanh ho\u7863?c h\u7841?t chanh d\f0\lang1033\'e2y c\'f2n d\f2\u432? trong ly n\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c\par
\f3\bullet  C\f2\u417?m ho\f1\u7863?c rau/th\u7883?t,... c\f0\lang1033\'f2n d\f2\u432? trong h\f1\lang1066\u7897?p c\f2\u417?m khi kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'f9ng h\f1\lang1066\u7871?t\par
\f3\bullet  H\f1\u7841?t tr\f0\lang1033\'e2n ch\'e2u c\'f2n th\f1\lang1066\u7915?a trong ly tr\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7919?a khi kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'f9ng h\f1\lang1066\u7871?t\par
16. Tr\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i 3 c\u7911?a tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng UEH g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3: Th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ph\u7849?m th\u7915?a, R\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871?, R\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f2n l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i\par
17. Tr\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i 7 c\u7911?a tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng UEH g\u7891?m: H\u7897?p s\u7919?a, Gi\u7845?y, Nh\u7921?a t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871?, Kim lo\u7841?i, Th\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a, Ch\u7845?t l\u7887?ng, R\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f2n l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i\par
18. Tr\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh UEH (UEH Go Green Station) l\'e0 n\f2\u417?i UEHer th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh b\'f3c t\'e1ch, ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\'e0o th\'f9ng r\'e1c\par
Nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u c\u7847?n bi\u7871?t\par
19. Trong m\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh Tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh m\'f4 h\'ecnh 3, R\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f2n l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i g\u7891?m T\f0\lang1033\'fai nilong, H\f1\lang1066\u7897?p x\u7889?p, D\u7909?ng c\u7909? \f2\'e3n u\f1\u7889?ng b\u7857?ng g\u7895?, Kh\f2\'e3n gi\f1\u7845?y, Kh\u7849?u trang, Chai l\u7885? m\u7843?nh v\u7905? thu\u7927? tinh, Thi\u7871?t b\u7883? \f2\'f0i\f1\u7879?n t\u7917?\par
20. Trong m\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh Tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh m\'f4 h\'ecnh 3, R\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f2n l\f1\lang1066\u7841?i g\u7891?m: T\f0\lang1033\'fai nilong, H\f1\lang1066\u7897?p x\u7889?p, D\u7909?ng c\u7909? \f2\'e3n u\f1\u7889?ng b\u7857?ng g\u7895?, Kh\f2\'e3n gi\f1\u7845?y, Kh\u7849?u trang, Chai l\u7885? m\u7843?nh v\u7905? thu\u7927? tinh, Thi\u7871?t b\u7883? \f2\'f0i\f1\u7879?n t\u7917?\par
21. Trong m\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh Tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh m\'f4 h\'ecnh 3, R\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i t\f0\lang1033\'e1i ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? g\u7891?m nh\u7919?ng nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m r\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i nh\f2\u432?: Kim lo\f1\u7841?i, R\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7921?a (tr\u7915? t\f0\lang1033\'fai nilong), Gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?y (tr\u7915? kh\f2\'e3n gi\f1\u7845?y), H\u7897?p s\u7919?a\par
22. Trong m\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh Tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\u7921?c h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh xanh m\'f4 h\'ecnh 3, Th\f1\lang1066\u7913?c \f2\'e3n th\f1\u7915?a g\u7891?m:\par
\f3\bullet Th\f1\u7921?c ph\u7849?m ch\f2\u432?a ho\f1\u7863?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 qua ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? bi\u7871?n\par
\f3\bullet  C\f0\lang1033\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i ch\u7845?t l\u7887?ng h\u7919?u c\f2\u417? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\f1\lang1066\u7863?n\par
\f3\bullet  R\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i s\f0\lang1033\'e2n v\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?n\par
23. Trong vi\u7879?c gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i th\u7913?c \f2\'e3n, \'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch mua \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7911?, d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7911?, d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng h\f1\lang1066\u7871?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? h\u7841?n ch\u7871? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f1\lang1066\u7843?i h\u7919?u c\f2\u417?.\par
24. Tr\u432?\f1\u7899?c khi x\u7843? th\u7843?i, UEHer, c\f0\lang1033\'e1 nh\'e2n ra v\'e0o UEH b\f1\lang1066\u7855?t bu\u7897?c ph\u7843?i B\f0\lang1033\'f3c t\'e1ch r\'e1c, Ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c.\par
25. Tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng UEH hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 3 v\'e0 7 c\'e1ch th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ph\'e2n lo\f1\lang1066\u7841?i r\f0\lang1033\'e1c\par
ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  2 : \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  \'e1n quy ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?\f0\lang1033 ch t\f1\lang1066\u7893?\f0\lang1033 ng th\f1\lang1066\u7875?\f0\lang1033  qu\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f0\lang1033 c gia th\f1\lang1066\u7901?\f0\lang1033 i k\f1\lang1066\u7923?\f0\lang1033  2021-2030 t\f1\lang1066\u7847?\f0\lang1033 m nh\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f0\lang1033 n n\f2\'e3\f0 m 2050\par
1. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 d\f1\lang1066\u7921?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f2\'e3n c\f1\lang1066\u7913? nh\u7919?ng v\f2\'e3n b\f1\u7843?n Lu\u7853?t Quy ho\u7841?ch, Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t \f2\'d0\f1\u7841?i h\u7897?i XIII c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng, Chi\u7871?n l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021-2030, C\f0\lang1033\'e1c ngh\f1\lang1066\u7883? quy\u7871?t, k\u7871?t lu\u7853?n c\u7911?a BCHTW \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng, B\u7897? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883?, Qu\u7889?c h\u7897?i... v\u7873? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 6 v\'f9ng kinh t\f1\lang1066\u7871? trong th\u7901?i k\u7923? m\u7899?i\f0\lang1033\par
2.\f2\'f0\f0\'e3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? ra nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\'e2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? y\u7871?u c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f1\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong t\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua. \f2\'d0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 do t\f2\u432? duy ph\f0\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n theo h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng d\f0\lang1033\'e0n tr\f1\lang1066\u7843?i, thi\u7871?u tr\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 Thi\f1\lang1066\u7871?u quy ho\u7841?ch mang t\f0\lang1033\'ednh t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia, d\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\f1\lang1066\u7841?n\par
\f0\lang1033 3. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? ra nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\'e2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? y\u7871?u c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f1\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong t\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua. \f2\'d0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 do vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c th\u7875? ch\u7871? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a v\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng c\f1\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng v\u7873? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng c\'f2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7853?m\par
4.\f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau c\'e1c h\f1\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong t\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua. Nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\'e2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? y\u7871?u l\f0\lang1033\'e0 do ch\f2\u432?a d\f0\'e0nh ngu\f1\lang1066\u7891?n l\u7921?c th\f0\lang1033\'edch \f2\'f0\f0\'e1ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7875? \f2\'f0\f1\u7847?u t\f2\u432? h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh b\f1\lang1066\u7897? khung k\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng qu\u7889?c gia, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\'f9ng; v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n b\u7873?n v\u7919?ng, h\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\'f2a kinh t\f1\lang1066\u7871? - v\f2\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a - x\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i - m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng ch\f2\u432?a th\f1\u7921?c s\u7921? \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c quan t\f0\lang1033\'e2m\par
5.\f2\'f0\f0\'e3 r\'fat ra b\'e0i h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c kinh nghi\u7879?m g\f0\lang1033\'ec qua vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c tr\u7841?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c huy \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng, s\u7917? d\u7909?ng ngu\u7891?n l\u7921?c ph\u7843?i x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd h\'e0i h\'f2a m\f1\lang1066\u7889?i quan h\u7879? gi\u7919?a ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\f1\lang1066\u7857?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy l\f1\lang1066\u7907?i th\u7871? c\u7841?nh tranh t\u7915?ng v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng, t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c, \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?t ph\f0\lang1033\'e1 ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n\par
6.\f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t l\'e0 ph\f1\lang1066\u7845?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?u \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2030 Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam s\u7869? l\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c \f2\'f0ang ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, thu nh\u7853?p trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh cao\par
7.\f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng ph\f1\u7845?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?u t\u7889?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? t\f2\'e3ng tr\u432?\f1\u7903?ng t\u7893?ng\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m trong n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c (GDP) c\u7843? n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 2031 - 2050, b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh qu\'e2n \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t 6,5 - 7,5%/n\f2\'e3m\par
8.\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?t m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050, GDP b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh qu\'e2n \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?u ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i theo gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t kho\u7843?ng 27.000\f0\lang1033  - \f1\lang1066 32.000 USD\par
9.\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?t m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050, t\f1\u7927? l\u7879? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f1\lang1066\u7883? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t 70 - 75%\par
10.\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?t m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050, GDP b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh qu\'e2n \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?u ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i theo gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t kho\u7843?ng 27.000 \f0\lang1033 - \f1\lang1066 32.000 USD\par
\f0\lang1033 11. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra nh\u7919?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng quy ho\u7841?ch g\u7891?m g\u7891?m: \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian kinh t\f1\lang1066\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i, \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian bi\f1\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t qu\u7889?c gia.\par
\f0\lang1033 12. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra nh\u7919?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng quy ho\u7841?ch g\u7891?m:\par
\f0\lang1033 . \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng khai th\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng tr\f1\lang1066\u7901?i\f0\lang1033\par
\f3\bullet  T\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng v\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng li\f0\lang1033\'ean k\f1\lang1066\u7871?t v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng\par
