4.\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 quy\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 t\u7855?c tr\f0\lang1033\'e1ch nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m l\f0\lang1033\'e0 ch\f1\lang1066\u7883?u tr\f0\lang1033\'e1ch nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7873? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh vi, \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng x\u7917? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i; ph\u7889?i h\u7907?p v\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\f2\u417? quan ch\f1\lang1066\u7913?c n\f2\'e3ng \'f0\f1\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd h\'e0nh vi, n\f1\lang1066\u7897?i dung th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin vi ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t.\par
Nh\u7919?ng v\u7845?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c: \par
1.\f2\'d0\f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c tr\u7841?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua, \ldblquote\f2\'d0\f1\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050\rdblquote  \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 r\'fat ra nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng b\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\f1\lang1066\u7885?c kinh nghi\u7879?m \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet\f0\lang1033  Quy ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch ph\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 t\f2\u432? duy \'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?t ph\f0\lang1033\'e1, t\f1\lang1066\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn chi\f1\lang1066\u7871?n l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?c\par
\f3\bullet  Ph\f1\u7843?i coi tr\u7885?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c ho\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n th\u7875? ch\u7871? v\u7873? t\u7893? ch\u7913?c l\u7853?p, qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd v\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n quy ho\u7841?ch\par
2. C\f2\'e3n c\f1\u7913? \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u 7, Lu\u7853?t An to\f0\lang1033\'e0n th\'f4ng tin m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng n\f2\'e3m 2015, h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi ph\'e1t t\'e1n th\f2\u432? r\f0\'e1c, ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n m\u7873?m \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?c h\u7841?i, thi\u7871?t l\u7853?p h\u7879? th\u7889?ng th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin gi\f1\lang1066\u7843? m\u7841?o, l\u7915?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?o b\u7883? nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam c\f1\lang1066\u7845?m.\par
3. H\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f1\lang1066\u7843?nh \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng trong c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ngh\u7883?, h\u7897?i th\u7843?o m\f0\lang1033\'e0 kh\'f4ng l\'e0m t\f1\lang1066\u7893?n h\u7841?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n danh d\u7921?, nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n ph\f1\lang1066\u7849?m, uy t\f0\lang1033\'edn c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 h\'ecnh \f1\lang1066\u7843?nh kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f1\lang1066\u7921? \f2\'f0\f1\u7891?ng \f0\lang1033\'fd c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 h\'ecnh \f1\lang1066\u7843?nh ho\u7863?c ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i di\u7879?n theo ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t c\u7911?a h\u7885?\par
4. Nh\u7919?ng nguy c\f2\u417? ti\f1\u7873?m \u7849?n khi s\u7917? d\u7909?ng Internet l\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 l\'e0:\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet\f0\lang1033  V\f1\lang1066\u7845?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? b\u7843?o m\u7853?t th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin; Th\'f4ng tin gi\f1\lang1066\u7843? m\u7841?o, sai l\u7879?ch, \f2\'f0\f1\u7891?i tr\u7909?y;\par
\f3\bullet\f1 M\u7845?t c\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\f1\lang1066\u7857?ng; B\u7841?o l\u7921?c, b\u7855?t n\u7841?t, qu\u7845?y r\u7889?i tr\u7921?c tuy\u7871?n;\par
\f3\bullet  Virus v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n m\u7873?m \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?c h\u7841?i;\par
\f0\lang1033 ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  4: h\f1\lang1066\u7897?\f0\lang1033 i ngh\f1\lang1066\u7883?\f0\lang1033  l\f1\lang1066\u7847?\f0\lang1033 n th\f1\lang1066\u7913?\f0\lang1033  s\'e1u ban ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?\f0\lang1033 p h\'e0nh trung \f2\u432?\u417?\f0 ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7843?\f0\lang1033 ng kho\'e1 XIII (10/2022)\par
1.\f2\'f0\f0\'e3 th\'f4ng qua c\'e1c n\f1\lang1066\u7897?i dung sau:\f3\par
\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 Ti\f1\u7871?p t\u7909?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam trong giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n m\u7899?i\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng th\f1\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? trong giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n m\u7899?i\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2030, t\f1\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066 2045\par
2. \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 th\'f4ng qua 4 n\f1\lang1066\u7897?i dung ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh, m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t trong s\u7889? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng Quy ho\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2050\par
3. Ngh\f1\u7883? quy\u7871?t v\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2030, t\f1\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2045\rdblquote  \'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng qua t\f1\lang1066\u7841?i H\u7897?i ngh\u7883? l\u7847?n th\u7913? s\f0\lang1033\'e1u c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a Ban Ch\u7845?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh Trung \f2\u432?\u417?ng \'d0\f1\lang1066\u7843?ng\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 kh\f0\lang1033\'f3a XIII\par
ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  5: m\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?\f0\lang1033 ng gi\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?\f0\lang1033 c \par
1.C\f2\'e3n c\f1\lang1066\u7913? \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u 58, Lu\u7853?t Gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c, nh\u7919?ng h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi m\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean kh\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0m g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m:\par
\f3\bullet  X\f0\lang1033\'fac ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m danh d\u7921?, nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n ph\f1\lang1066\u7849?m, x\f0\lang1033\'e2m ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7875? ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i h\u7885?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c\par
\f3\bullet  Gian l\f1\lang1066\u7853?n trong ho\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e0o t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, nghi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f1\lang1066\u7913?u khoa h\u7885?c\par
L\u7907?i d\u7909?ng danh hi\u7879?u nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\'e1o v\'e0 ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi vi ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t\par
2. C\f2\'e3n c\f1\u7913? \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u 61, Lu\u7853?t Gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c, h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi m\'e0 ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i h\u7885?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0m g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m:\par
\f3\bullet  X\f0\lang1033\'fac ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n ph\f1\lang1066\u7849?m, danh d\u7921?, x\f0\lang1033\'e2m ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m th\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7875? gi\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean, c\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd gi\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c, nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n vi\'ean, ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i h\u7885?c c\u7911?a c\f2\u417? s\f1\u7903? gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c;\par
\f3\bullet  Gian l\f1\lang1066\u7853?n trong h\u7885?c t\u7853?p, ki\u7875?m tra, thi c\u7917?, tuy\u7875?n sinh;\par
\f3\bullet  Tham gia t\f1\u7879? n\u7841?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i, g\f0\lang1033\'e2y r\f1\lang1066\u7889?i an ninh tr\u7853?t t\u7921? trong c\f2\u417? s\f1\u7903? gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c ho\u7863?c n\f2\u417?i c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c h\'e0nh vi vi ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c; T\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c ho\u7863?c tham gia c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng vi ph\u7841?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t;\par
3. C\f2\'e3n c\f1\u7913? \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u 62, Lu\u7853?t Gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\u7885?c, ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i h\u7885?c \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c h\f2\u432?\f1\u7903?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\'e1c ch\'ednh s\'e1ch v\f1\lang1066\u7873? h\u7885?c b\u7893?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tr\f1\lang1066\u7907? c\u7845?p x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i, ch\u7871? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? c\u7917? tuy\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\'edn d\f1\lang1066\u7909?ng gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c\par
4. C\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c an ninh, tr\f1\lang1066\u7853?t t\u7921?, an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng h\u7885?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? c\u7853?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n nh\u7919?ng v\u7845?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3: B\f1\lang1066\u7841?o l\u7921?c h\u7885?c \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng; X\f0\lang1033\'e2m h\f1\lang1066\u7841?i t\f0\lang1033\'ecnh d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c h\u7885?c \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng; Tai n\u7841?n, th\f2\u432?\u417?ng t\f0\lang1033\'edch; thi\'ean tai, th\f1\lang1066\u7843?m h\u7885?a, d\u7883?ch b\u7879?nh...\par
\f0\lang1033 ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  6 lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?\f0\lang1033 t an to\'e0n giao th\'f4ng \par
C\f2\'e3n c\f1\lang1066\u7913? \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u 8, Lu\u7853?t Giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?, nh\u7919?ng h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi b\f1\lang1066\u7883? nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam c\f1\lang1066\u7845?m g\u7891?m:\f0\lang1033\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet  \f2\lang1033\'d0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe c\f2\u417? gi\f1\u7899?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\'f3 gi\f1\lang1066\u7845?y ph\f0\lang1033\'e9p l\'e1i xe theo quy \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh\par
\f3\bullet  Giao xe c\f2\u417? gi\f1\u7899?i, xe m\f0\lang1033\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng cho ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7911? \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u ki\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe tham gia giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe c\f2\u417? gi\f1\u7899?i ch\u7841?y qu\f0\lang1033\'e1 t\f1\lang1066\u7889?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? quy \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh, gi\f0\lang1033\'e0nh \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng, v\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?t \u7849?u\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0ua xe, c\f1\u7893? v\f2\u361? \'f0ua xe, t\f1\u7893? ch\u7913?c \f2\'f0ua xe tr\f0\lang1033\'e1i ph\'e9p, l\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e1ch, \f2\'f0\f0\'e1nh v\'f5ng\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet  \f0\lang1033  \f2\'d0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng ti\f1\u7879?n giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897? m\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong c\f2\u417? th\f1\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t ma t\f0\lang1033\'fay\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet  \f0\lang1033  \f2\'d0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe \f0\lang1033\'f4 t\'f4, m\'e1y k\'e9o, xe m\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng tr\'ean \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng m\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong m\'e1u ho\f1\lang1066\u7863?c h\f2\u417?i th\f1\u7903? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 n\f1\lang1066\u7891?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? c\u7891?n\par
\f3\bullet  \f1 B\u7845?m c\f0\lang1033\'f2i, r\'fa ga li\'ean t\f1\lang1066\u7909?c; b\u7845?m c\f0\lang1033\'f2i trong th\f1\lang1066\u7901?i gian t\u7915? 22 gi\u7901? \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n 5 gi\u7901?, b\u7845?m c\f0\lang1033\'f2i h\f2\u417?i, s\f1\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e8n chi\f1\lang1066\u7871?u xa trong \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f1\lang1066\u7883? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 khu \f2\'f0\f0\'f4ng d\'e2n c\f2\u432?, tr\f1\lang1066\u7915? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c xe \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c quy\u7873?n \f2\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean \f2\'f0ang \'f0i l\f0\'e0m nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? theo quy \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh\par
\f3\bullet  \f1  L\u7855?p \f2\'f0\f1\u7863?t, s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f2i, \f2\'f0\f0\'e8n kh\'f4ng \f2\'f0\f0\'fang thi\f1\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? c\u7911?a nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i t\u7915?ng lo\u7841?i xe c\f2\u417? gi\f1\u7899?i; s\u7917? d\u7909?ng thi\u7871?t b\u7883? \f0\lang1033\'e2m thanh g\'e2y m\f1\lang1066\u7845?t tr\u7853?t t\u7921? an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n giao th\'f4ng, tr\f1\lang1066\u7853?t t\u7921? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0\u432?a xe c\u417? gi\f1\u7899?i, xe m\f0\lang1033\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng kh\'f4ng b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m ti\f0\lang1033\'eau chu\f1\lang1066\u7849?n an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n k\f1\lang1066\u7929? thu\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng tham gia giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?\par
\f3\bullet  B\f1\u7887? tr\u7889?n sau khi g\f0\lang1033\'e2y tai n\f1\lang1066\u7841?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? tr\u7889?n tr\f0\lang1033\'e1nh tr\'e1ch nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m\par
\f3\bullet  Khi c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u ki\u7879?n m\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f1\lang1066\u7889? \f0\lang1033\'fd kh\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7913?u gi\f0\lang1033\'fap ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i b\u7883? tai n\u7841?n giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng\par
\f3\bullet  X\f0\'e2m ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m t\f0\lang1033\'ednh m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng, s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e, t\f0\lang1033\'e0i s\f1\lang1066\u7843?n c\u7911?a ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i b\u7883? n\u7841?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i g\f0\lang1033\'e2y tai n\f1\lang1066\u7841?n\par
2. Nh\u7919?ng k\u7929? n\f2\'e3ng c\f1\u7847?n thi\u7871?t cho ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe g\u7855?n m\f0\lang1033\'e1y khi tham gia giao th\'f4ng g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m:\f0\lang1033\par
\f3\bullet\f0  Gi\f1\lang1066\u7919? t\u7853?p trung; Gi\u7919? tinh th\u7847?n t\u7881?nh t\f0\lang1033\'e1o khi l\'e1i xe;\par
\f3\bullet\f0  \f3 Hi\f1\lang1066\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'f5 v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote c\f2\u417? th\f1\u7875?\rdblquote  v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \ldblquote t\'ednh c\'e1ch\rdblquote  c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a xe; T\u7853?p th\f0\lang1033\'f3i quen nh\'ecn g\f2\u432?\u417?ng chi\f1\lang1066\u7871?u h\u7853?u khi \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe; B\u7843?o d\f2\u432?\f1\u7905?ng xe \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh k\u7923? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ki\f1\lang1066\u7875?m tra xe tr\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c khi \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n;\par
\f3\bullet  N\f1\u7855?m v\u7919?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tu\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7911? lu\u7853?t l\u7879? giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng; H\'e3y ki\'ean nh\f1\lang1066\u7851?n khi \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe m\f0\lang1033\'e1y;\par
3. Ph\f1\lang1066\u7841?m vi \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u ch\u7881?nh c\u7911?a Lu\u7853?t Giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897? l\f0\lang1033\'e0:\par
\f3\bullet  Quy t\f1\lang1066\u7855?c giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?; K\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?;\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 Ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng ti\f1\u7879?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i tham gia giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?;\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 V\u7853?n t\u7843?i \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng b\u7897? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 qu\f1\lang1066\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd nh\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c v\u7873? giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?;\par
4. C\f0\lang1033\'e1c k\f1\lang1066\u7929? n\f2\'e3ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n thi\u7871?t cho ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe g\u7855?n m\f0\lang1033\'e1y khi tham gia giao th\'f4ng, k\f1\lang1066\u7929? n\f2\'e3ng n\f1\u7855?m v\u7919?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tu\'e2n th\f1\lang1066\u7911? lu\u7853?t l\u7879? giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng khi \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe g\u7855?n m\f0\lang1033\'e1y l\'e0\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0i \'f0\f0\'fang t\f1\lang1066\u7889?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? cho ph\f0\lang1033\'e9p \f1\lang1066\u7903? m\u7895?i khu v\u7921?c m\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f2\'f0ang di chuy\f1\lang1066\u7875?n;\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0i \'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang l\'e0n \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?ng c\u7911?a m\f0\lang1033\'ecnh, kh\'f4ng n\'ean ch\f1\lang1066\u7841?y l\u7845?n qua l\f0\lang1033\'e0n \'f4 t\'f4;\par
\f3\bullet\f0  D\f1\lang1066\u7915?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e8n \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7887? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang v\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f0\'fang ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n d\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?ng d\f0\lang1033\'e0nh cho xe g\f1\lang1066\u7855?n m\f0\lang1033\'e1y;\par
5.C\'e1c k\f1\lang1066\u7929? n\f2\'e3ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n thi\u7871?t cho ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i \f2\'f0i\f1\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe g\u7855?n m\f0\lang1033\'e1y khi tham gia giao th\'f4ng, k\f1\lang1066\u7929? n\f2\'e3ng gi\f1\u7919? t\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\f1\lang1066\u7847?n t\u7881?nh t\f0\lang1033\'e1o khi l\'e1i xe l\'e0: Kh\'f4ng l\'e1i xe sau khi \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 u\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng r\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?u, bia ho\u7863?c khi tinh th\u7847?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c t\u7881?nh t\f0\lang1033\'e1o.\par
Ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  7 t\f2\u432?\f0  t\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7903?\f0\lang1033 ng H\f1\lang1066\u7891?\f0\lang1033  Ch\'ed Minh\par
1.V\f2\'e3n h\f0\'f3a trong t\f2\u432? t\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7903?ng H\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh l\'e0\par
\f3\bullet  Kh\f0\'e1i qu\'e1t n\f1\lang1066\u7897?i dung r\u7897?ng nh\u7845?t c\u7911?a ph\u7841?m tr\f0\lang1033\'f9 v\f2\'e3n h\f0\'f3a\par
\f3\bullet  Bao h\f0\'e0m c\'e1c ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng v\u7853?t ch\u7845?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tinh th\f1\lang1066\u7847?n c\u7911?a con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f9ng v\f1\lang1066\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c gi\'e1 tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? m\f0\lang1033\'e0 con ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i s\f0\lang1033\'e1ng t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ra\par
\f3\bullet  Nhu c\f1\u7847?u sinh t\u7891?n c\u7911?a con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i v\u7899?i t\f2\u432? c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? th\u7875? ho\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng c\u7911?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7901?i s\u7889?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh l\'e0 ngu\f1\lang1066\u7891?n g\u7889?c, \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng l\u7921?c s\f0\lang1033\'e2u xa c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a v\f2\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a\par
2. T\f2\u432? t\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7903?ng, \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7913?c, phong c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch H\f1\lang1066\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh v\f1\lang1066\u7873? "vai tr\f0\lang1033\'f2 c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i" \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0:\par
\f3\bullet  con ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 v\f1\lang1066\u7889?n qu\f0\lang1033\'fd nh\f1\lang1066\u7845?t, nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f1\lang1066\u7889? quy\u7871?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a s\u7921? nghi\u7879?p c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch mang\par
\f3\bullet  con ng\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7901?i v\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f1\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau, v\f1\lang1066\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng\par
3. T\f2\u432? t\u432?\f1\u7903?ng, \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7913?c, phong c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch H\f1\lang1066\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh v\f1\lang1066\u7873? v\u7883? tr\f0\lang1033\'ed, vai tr\'f2 c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a v\f2\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 l\'e0:\par
\f3\bullet  v\f2\'e3n h\f0\'f3a l\'e0 m\f1\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau, \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c c\u7911?a s\u7921? nghi\u7879?p c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ng\par
\f3\bullet  v\f2\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a ph\f1\lang1066\u7909?c v\u7909? qu\u7847?n ch\f0\lang1033\'fang Nh\'e2n d\'e2n\par
Ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  8 Ngh\f1\lang1066\u7883?\f0\lang1033  quy\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f0\lang1033 t s\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f0\lang1033  27-NQ/TW, ng\'e0y 9/11/2022\par
- M\f1\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 27- NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 9/11/2022 v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i. ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam trong giai \f2\'f0o\f1\u7841?n m\u7899?i\rdblquote , \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? ra \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam c\u7911?a Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n, do Nh\'e2n d\'e2n, v\'ec Nh\'e2n d\'e2n, do \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7843?ng C\u7897?ng s\u7843?n Vi\u7879?t Nam l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o\par
1.\f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh t\f1\lang1066\u7921?u/k\u7871?t qu\u7843? quan tr\u7885?ng trong x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n XHCN Vi\u7879?t Nam qua h\f2\u417?n 35 n\'e3m \'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i g\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3:\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet  \f0\lang1033  Nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?n th\u7913?c, l\f0\lang1033\'fd lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?n v\u7873? Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y c\'e0ng th\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t, \f2\'f0\f1\u7847?y \f2\'f0\f1\u7911? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\'e2u s\f1\lang1066\u7855?c h\f2\u417?n\par
\f3\bullet  C\f2\u417? ch\f1\u7871? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n c\'f4ng, ph\f1\lang1066\u7889?i h\u7907?p v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ki\f1\lang1066\u7875?m so\f0\lang1033\'e1t gi\f1\lang1066\u7919?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\f2\u417? quan nh\f0\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c trong th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n l\u7853?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p, h\'e0nh ph\'e1p, t\f2\u432? ph\f0\'e1p ng\'e0y c\'e0ng r\'f5 h\f2\u417?n v\f0\'e0 c\'f3 chuy\f1\lang1066\u7875?n bi\u7871?n t\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f1\lang1066\u7921?c\f3\par
\bullet  Quy\f1\u7873?n con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i, quy\u7873?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'e2n theo Hi\f1\lang1066\u7871?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c c\u7909? th\u7875? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a b\f1\lang1066\u7857?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n t\u7889?t h\f2\u417?n tr\f0\lang1033\'ean th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c t\u7871?; d\f0\lang1033\'e2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? tr\u7921?c ti\u7871?p v\f0\lang1033\'e0 d\'e2n ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i di\u7879?n \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c t\f2\'e3ng c\u432?\f1\u7901?ng\par
\f3\bullet  \f1 Ho\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng c\u7911?a M\u7863?t tr\u7853?n T\u7893? qu\u7889?c Vi\u7879?t Nam v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i t\u7915?ng b\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i\par
\f3\bullet  M\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh Nh\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ng\f1\lang1066\u7915?ng \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n, v\u7853?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh theo c\f2\u417? ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? \ldblquote\f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd, Nh\'e2n d\'e2n l\'e0m ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\rdblquote\par
2. \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh nh\u7919?ng quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o sau \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e2y:\par
\f3\bullet  Ki\f0\'ean \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh, v\u7853?n d\u7909?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n s\f0\lang1033\'e1ng t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a M\f0\lang1033\'e1c - L\'eanin, t\f2\u432? t\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7903?ng H\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh\par
\f3\bullet  Ki\f0\'ean \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c l\u7853?p d\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f1\lang1066\u7897?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i\par
\f3\bullet  Ki\f0\lang1033\'ean \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\u7889?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m s\u7921? l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng\par
3. \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra 5 quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m, trong \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 quan \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7875?m th\u7913? hai l\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n nh\u7845?t qu\f0\lang1033\'e1n nguy\'ean t\f1\lang1066\u7855?c t\u7845?t c\u7843? quy\u7873?n l\u7921?c nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c thu\u7897?c v\u7873? Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n, ph\'e1t huy quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n l\f0\lang1033\'e0m ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? c\u7911?a Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n trong Nh\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a Vi\f1\u7879?t Nam\par
4. \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh 5 quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o, trong \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3, g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m nh\u7919?ng n\u7897?i dung sau:\par
\f3\bullet  B\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ti\u7877?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 xu th\f1\lang1066\u7871? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n c\u7911?a th\u7901?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, k\u7871? th\u7915?a nh\u7919?ng th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh t\f1\lang1066\u7921?u \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c, ti\u7871?p\f0\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 thu c\f0\lang1033\'f3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7885?n l\u7885?c kinh nghi\u7879?m qu\u7889?c t\u7871? ph\f0\lang1033\'f9 h\f1\lang1066\u7907?p v\u7899?i Vi\u7879?t Nam\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 K\u7871?t h\u7907?p s\u7913?c m\u7841?nh d\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f1\lang1066\u7897?c v\u7899?i s\u7913?c m\u7841?nh th\u7901?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, s\u7913?c m\u7841?nh qu\u7889?c gia v\u7899?i s\u7913?c m\u7841?nh qu\u7889?c t\u7871?\par
\f3\bullet  B\f1\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m cao nh\u7845?t l\u7907?i \f0\lang1033\'edch qu\f1\lang1066\u7889?c gia - d\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f1\lang1066\u7897?c, b\u7843?o v\u7879? v\u7919?ng ch\u7855?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?c l\u7853?p, ch\u7911? quy\u7873?n, th\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 to\'e0n v\f1\lang1066\u7865?n l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh th\f1\lang1066\u7893?, an ninh qu\u7889?c gia, ch\u7871? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a\par
5. \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o g\u7891?m:\par
\f3\bullet  B\f1\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m t\u7893?ng th\u7875?, \f2\'f0\f1\u7891?ng b\u7897?, li\f0\lang1033\'ean th\'f4ng gi\f1\lang1066\u7919?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i l\u7853?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p, c\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch h\'e0nh ch\'ednh, c\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch t\f2\u432? ph\f0\'e1p\par
\f3\lang1066\bullet\f0\lang1033  K\f1\lang1066\u7871?t h\u7907?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\'f2a gi\f1\lang1066\u7919?a k\u7871? th\u7915?a, \u7893?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh v\u7899?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 Ti\u7871?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh kh\f1\lang1066\u7849?n tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam minh, nh\f1\lang1066\u7845?t qu\f0\lang1033\'e1n, c\'f3 tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 l\f1\lang1066\u7897? tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh, b\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c \f2\'f0i v\f1\u7919?ng ch\u7855?c\par
6. \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? ra m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?i ng\f2\u361? c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897?, c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ch\f1\lang1066\u7913?c, vi\f0\lang1033\'ean ch\f1\lang1066\u7913?c c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7911? ph\u7849?m ch\u7845?t, n\f2\'e3ng l\f1\u7921?c, th\u7921?c s\u7921? chuy\f0\lang1033\'ean nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p, li\f0\lang1033\'eam ch\'ednh\par
7. \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3, m\f1\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng\par
\f3\bullet Quy\f1\u7873?n l\u7921?c nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t, \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n c\'f4ng r\'e0nh m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch, ph\u7889?i h\u7907?p ch\u7863?t ch\u7869?, ki\u7875?m so\f0\lang1033\'e1t hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843?; n\u7873?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ch\'ednh, t\f2\u432? ph\f0\'e1p chuy\'ean nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n, hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i\par
\f3\bullet  Th\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng t\f0\lang1033\'f4n Hi\f1\lang1066\u7871?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\'e0 ph\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t, t\f0\lang1033\'f4n tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng, b\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m, b\u7843?o v\u7879? hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? quy\u7873?n con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i, quy\u7873?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'e2n\par
\lang9 8. \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng\f3\lang1033\par
\bullet\f0  \f3 Quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n l\u7921?c nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t, \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n c\'f4ng r\'e0nh m\f1\lang1066\u7841?ch, ph\u7889?i h\u7907?p ch\u7863?t ch\u7869?, ki\u7875?m so\f0\lang1033\'e1t hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843?; n\u7873?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ch\'ednh, t\f2\u432? ph\f0\'e1p chuy\'ean nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n, hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 B\u7897? m\f0\lang1033\'e1y nh\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c tinh g\u7885?n, trong s\u7841?ch, ho\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng hi\u7879?u l\u7921?c, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843?\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 Qu\u7843?n tr\u7883? qu\u7889?c gia hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843?\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f2\lang1066\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng y\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f1\lang1066\u7847?u ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c nhanh, b\u7873?n v\u7919?ng, tr\u7903? th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 thu nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?p cao theo \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a v\f0\lang1033\'e0o n\f2\'e3m 2045\par
9. \'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n, trong \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m g\f1\lang1066\u7891?m c\f0\lang1033\'f3 nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng n\u7897?i dung:\par
\f3\bullet  Ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f2\u417? ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam minh, nh\f1\lang1066\u7845?t qu\f0\lang1033\'e1n\par
\f3\bullet  Ho\f0\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n c\f2\u417? ch\f1\u7871? ki\u7875?m so\f0\lang1033\'e1t quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n l\u7921?c nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c, \f2\'f0\f1\u7849?y m\u7841?nh ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng, ch\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng tham nh\f2\u361?ng, ti\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f1\lang1066\u7921?c\f3\par
\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f2\lang1066\'d0\f1\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch t\f2\u432? ph\f0\'e1p, b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m t\f0\lang1033\'ednh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?c l\u7853?p c\u7911?a t\f0\lang1033\'f2a \'e1n theo th\f1\lang1066\u7849?m quy\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e9t x\f1\lang1066\u7917?, th\u7849?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1n, h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i th\u7849?m x\f0\lang1033\'e9t x\f1\lang1066\u7917? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?c l\u7853?p v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? tu\f0\lang1033\'e2n theo ph\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t\par
\f3\bullet  Ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f2\u417? ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam minh, nh\f1\lang1066\u7845?t qu\f0\lang1033\'e1n; b\f1\lang1066\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m th\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng t\f0\lang1033\'f4n Hi\f1\lang1066\u7871?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\'e0 ph\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t; n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng ngu\u7891?n nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n l\f1\lang1066\u7921?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t\par
10. x\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'f3m nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p n\'e0o, m\f1\lang1066\u7897?t trong s\u7889? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0\par
\f3\bullet\f0  Ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i t\u7893? ch\u7913?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng c\u7911?a Ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh ph\f1\lang1066\u7911?, ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?a ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f2\lang1066 X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng n\u7873?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh ch\'ednh nh\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\u7909?c v\u7909? Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n, chuy\'ean nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n, hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, hi\u7879?u l\u7921?c, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843?\f0\lang9\par
11. \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra 8 nhi\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3, x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng\f3\lang1033\par
\bullet\f0  \f3 Ti\f1\lang1066\u7871?p t\u7909?c ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\f2\u417? ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam minh, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843?, b\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m y\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f1\lang1066\u7847?u ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c nhanh v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f1\lang1066\u7873?n v\u7919?ng\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i t\u7893? ch\u7913?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\'e2ng cao ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng ho\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng c\u7911?a Qu\u7889?c h\u7897?i\par
12. \f2\'f0\f1\u7873? ra 8 nhi\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3, nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n t\u7889?t thi\u7871?t ch\u7871? Ch\u7911? t\u7883?ch n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 Nh\f1\u7853?n th\u7913?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang, \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?y \f2\'f0\f1\u7911?, s\f0\lang1033\'e2u s\f1\lang1066\u7855?c v\u7873? v\u7883? tr\f0\lang1033\'ed, quy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n h\u7841?n, nhi\u7879?m v\u7909? c\u7911?a Ch\u7911? t\u7883?ch n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c v\u7899?i vai tr\f0\lang1033\'f2 l\'e0 nguy\'ean th\f1\lang1066\u7911? qu\u7889?c gia\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c nghi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f1\lang1066\u7913?u l\f0\lang1033\'e0m r\'f5 h\f2\u417?n nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909?, quy\u7873?n h\u7841?n c\u7911?a Ch\u7911? t\u7883?ch n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c trong vai tr\f0\lang1033\'f2 th\f1\lang1066\u7889?ng l\f2\u297?nh c\f0\lang1033\'e1c l\f1\lang1066\u7921?c l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng v\f2\u361? trang nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n, Ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? t\u7883?ch H\u7897?i \f2\'f0\f1\u7891?ng Qu\u7889?c ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng v\'e0 An ninh, trong ho\f1\lang1066\u7841?t \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i n\u7897?i, \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i ngo\u7841?i, trong m\u7889?i quan h\u7879? v\u7899?i Qu\u7889?c h\u7897?i, Ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh ph\f1\lang1066\u7911?, T\f0\lang1033\'f2a \'e1n\par
13. \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra 8 nhi\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p, trong \f2\'f0\f0\'f3, nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote T\f2\'e3ng c\u432?\f1\u7901?ng, ch\u7911? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng h\u7897?i nh\u7853?p qu\u7889?c t\u7871? \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng\f3\par
\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f3\lang1066 Ti\f1\u7871?p t\u7909?c ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n c\f2\u417? ch\f1\u7871? \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? ch\u7911? \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng, t\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f1\lang1066\u7921?c h\u7897?i nh\u7853?p qu\u7889?c t\u7871? to\f0\lang1033\'e0n di\f1\lang1066\u7879?n, s\f0\lang1033\'e2u r\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng, th\u7921?c ch\u7845?t, hi\u7879?u qu\f0\lang1033\'e0\par
\f3\bullet\f0  N\'e2ng cao hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843?, ch\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e0o t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n l\f1\lang1066\u7921?c h\u7907?p t\f0\lang1033\'e1c ph\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t qu\u7889?c t\u7871?\par
\f3\lang1033\bullet\f0  \f1\lang1066 T\f2\'e3ng c\u432?\f1\u7901?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c th\'f4ng tin \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7889?i ngo\u7841?i v\u7873? ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, \'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\u7889?i c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng, ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch, ph\'e1p lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t c\u7911?a Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c\par
\f0\lang1033 Ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f0\lang1033  \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033  9: Ngh\f1\lang1066\u7883?\f0\lang1033  quy\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f0\lang1033 t s\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f0\lang1033  28-NQ/TW ng\'e0y 17/11/2022\par
1.\f2\'f0\f0\'e3 t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng k\u7871?t r\u7857?ng, sau 15 n\f2\'e3m th\f1\u7921?c hi\u7879?n Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 15-NQ/TW ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 30/7/2007 c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a Ban Ch\u7845?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh Trung \f2\u432?\u417?ng\par
 \f3\bullet  B\f1\lang1066\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'fang c\f2\u417? ch\f1\lang1066\u7871? \ldblquote\f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd, Nh\'e2n d\'e2n l\'e0m ch\f1\lang1066\u7911?\rdblquote\par
\f3\bullet  Ch\f1\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?i ng\f2\u361? c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng l\'ean\par
 \f3\lang1066\bullet\f0\lang1033  C\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\f1\lang1066\u7875?m tra, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7849?y m\u7841?nh\par
\f3\bullet  G\f0\lang1033\'f3p ph\f1\lang1066\u7847?n quan tr\u7885?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0o vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao n\f2\'e3ng l\f1\lang1066\u7921?c c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n, b\u7843?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?m s\u7921? l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o to\f0\lang1033\'e0n di\f1\lang1066\u7879?n, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e0ng\par
2.\f2\'f0\f0\'e3 ch\f1\lang1066\u7881? ra h\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong 15 n\f2\'e3m th\f1\u7921?c hi\u7879?n Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 15-NQ/TW (30/7/2007) c\u7911?a BCHTW g\u7891?m:\f3\par
\bullet  M\f1\u7897?t s\u7889? ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, \'f0\f1\u7883?nh h\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?ng l\u7899?n c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng ch\f2\u432?a \'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c th\u7875? ch\u7871? k\u7883?p th\u7901?i, \f2\'f0\f1\u7847?y \f2\'f0\f1\u7911? ho\u7863?c \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? ch\u7871? nh\f2\u432?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng kh\f1\lang1066\u7843? thi\par
\f3\bullet  M\f0\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng th\u7875? c\u7911?a h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? ch\f2\u432?a ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n\par
\f3\bullet  Ch\f2\u432?a ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy t\f1\lang1066\u7889?t vai tr\f0\lang1033\'f2 c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a M\u7863?t tr\u7853?n T\u7893? qu\u7889?c Vi\u7879?t Nam, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i v\f0\lang1033\'e0 Nh\'e2n d\'e2n tham gia x\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng, x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f1\lang1066\u7921?ng h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883?\par
C\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c tuy\'ean truy\f1\lang1066\u7873?n, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f1\lang1066\u7909?c ch\f2\u432?a t\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n m\u7897?t s\u7889? \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i t\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng, \f2\'f0\f1\u7883?a b\f0\lang1033\'e0n...\par
\f3\bullet  C\f1\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch h\'e0nh ch\'ednh, \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i phong c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch, l\f1\lang1066\u7873? l\u7889?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0m vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c trong \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng ch\f2\u432?a \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f1\lang1066\u7913?ng y\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f1\lang1066\u7847?u c\u7911?a t\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\'ecnh m\f1\lang1066\u7899?i\par
\f3\bullet  Nh\f1\u7853?n th\u7913?c c\u7911?a m\u7897?t s\u7889? c\u7845?p \u7911?y, t\u7893? ch\u7913?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?ng, c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897?, \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean v\f1\lang1066\u7873? \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng th\f1\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883? ch\f2\u432?a \'f0\f1\u7847?y \f2\'f0\f1\u7911?, s\f0\lang1033\'e2u s\f1\lang1066\u7855?c, thi\u7871?u th\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t, \f2\'f0\f1\u7891?ng b\u7897? trong qu\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\'ecnh t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n\par
\f3\bullet\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 N\f2\'e3ng l\f1\u7921?c c\u7909? th\u7875? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a v\'e0 l\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o, t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, \'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\u7889?i c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f2n h\f1\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? ch\f2\u432?a cao\par
\f3\bullet  Ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch c\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? ch\f2\u432?a th\f1\u7921?c s\u7921? t\u7841?o \f2\'f0\f1\u7897?ng l\u7921?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897? to\f0\lang1033\'e0n t\'e2m, to\'e0n \'fd v\f1\lang1066\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?c\par
Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 28-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022\par
3. Nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f1\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f2\'f0\f0\'f3 l\'e0\par
\f3\bullet  \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c, c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897?.\par
\f3\bullet\f2\'d0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng ban h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh v\'e0 t\f1\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?t hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? cao ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, \'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\u7889?i c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng.\par
\f3\bullet  Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy vai tr\'f2, tr\'e1ch nhi\f1\lang1066\u7879?m n\f0\lang1033\'eau g\f2\u432?\u417?ng c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f1\lang1066\u7897?, \f2\'f0\f1\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean.\par
\f3\bullet\f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f1\lang1066\u7845?t l\f2\u432?\f1\u7907?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\f1\lang1066\u7875?m tra, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t.\par
4. M\f1\lang1066\u7897?t trong nh\u7919?ng n\u7897?i dung quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0\f3\par
\bullet  \f2\'d0\f1\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng th\f1\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng ph\u7843?i ki\f0\lang1033\'ean \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh, v\u7853?n d\u7909?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n s\f0\lang1033\'e1ng t\f1\lang1066\u7841?o ch\u7911? ngh\f2\u297?a M\f0\lang1033\'e1c - L\'eanin, t\f2\u432? t\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7903?ng H\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh\par
\f3\bullet\f0  N\'e2ng cao n\f2\'e3ng l\f1\lang1066\u7921?c t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ch\u7911? tr\f2\u432?\u417?ng, \'f0\u432?\f1\u7901?ng l\u7889?i c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng, nh\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\f1\lang1066\u7875? ch\u7871? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, c\f1\lang1066\u7909? th\u7875? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a th\'e0nh lu\f1\lang1066\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c v\f2\'e3n b\f1\lang1066\u7843?n d\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?i lu\u7853?t\par
\f3\bullet  T\f1\u7841?o chuy\u7875?n bi\u7871?n m\u7841?nh m\u7869?, th\u7921?c ch\u7845?t trong \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng th\f1\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?o c\u7911?a \f2\'d0\f1\u7843?ng \f2\'f0\f1\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tri\par
