 3.\f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 kh\'e1i qu\'e1t nh\f1\lang1066\u7919?ng k\u7871?t qu\u7843? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?t \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c sau h\f2\u417?n 35 n\'e3m \'f0\f1\u7893?i m\u7899?i, nh\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong 10 n\f2\'e3m 2011 - 2020, th\f1\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7841?t 72,7%\par
