7. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7863?t ra m\u7897?t s\u7889? ch\u7881? ti\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f1\lang1066\u7909? th\u7875? \f2\'f0\f1\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2030, trong \'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3, t\f1\lang1066\u7889?c \f2\'f0\f1\u7897? t\f2\'e3ng tr\u432?\f1\u7903?ng b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh qu\'e2n c\f1\lang1066\u7847?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?t 7%\par
