\f3\bullet  C\f0\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0 qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh chuy\f1\lang1066\u7875?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7893?i c\f2\'e3n b\f1\u7843?n, to\f0\lang1033\'e0n di\f1\lang1066\u7879?n n\u7873?n kinh t\u7871? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7901?i s\u7889?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f1\lang1066\u7897?i\par
