\f3\bullet  C\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a ph\f1\lang1066\u7843?i khai th\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\'e0 ph\'e1t huy t\f1\lang1066\u7889?t nh\u7845?t m\u7885?i ti\u7873?m n\f2\'e3ng, l\f1\u7907?i th\u7871? c\u7911?a \f2\'f0\f1\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c, c\u7911?a t\u7915?ng v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng v\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?a ph\f2\u432?\u417?ng\par
\f3\bullet  Vi\f1\u7879?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\u7847?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\f1\lang1066\u7897? tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh v\'e0 b\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c \f2\'f0i c\f1\u7909? th\u7875?, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f1\lang1066\u7885?ng \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m\par
