10. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7873? ra 5 quan \f2\'f0i\f1\u7875?m ch\u7881? \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?o, trong \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3, quan \f2\'f0i\f1\lang1066\u7875?m th\u7913? hai \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f1\lang1066\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7845?t n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f1\lang1066\u7921? nghi\u7879?p c\u7911?a to\f0\lang1033\'e0n d\'e2n v\'e0 c\f1\lang1066\u7843? h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f1\lang1066\u7883?, l\u7845?y con ng\f2\u432?\f1\u7901?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 trung t\'e2m, doanh nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p l\f0\lang1033\'e0 ch\f1\lang1066\u7911? th\u7875?\par
11. \f2\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 x\'e1c \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7883?nh m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau t\f1\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2030 l\f0\lang1033\'e0 Vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?t Nam c\f2\u417? b\f1\u7843?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?t \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\u7907?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ti\'eau ch\'ed c\f1\lang1066\u7911?a n\f2\u432?\f1\u7899?c c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p, l\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c \f2\'f0ang ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p hi\u7879?n \f2\'f0\f1\u7841?i, thu nh\u7853?p trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh cao; \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7901?i s\u7889?ng c\u7911?a Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n \f2\'f0\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao\par
12. \f2\'f0\f0\'e3 \f2\'f0\u432?a ra t\f1\lang1066\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7871?n n\f2\'e3m 2045 l\f0\lang1033\'e0 Vi\f1\lang1066\u7879?t Nam tr\u7903? th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 thu nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?p cao, thu\u7897?c nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m c\'e1c n\f2\u432?\f1\lang1066\u7899?c c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f1\lang1066\u7879?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f1\lang1066\u7875?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0ng \f2\'f0\f1\lang1066\u7847?u khu v\u7921?c Ch\f0\lang1033\'e2u \'c1\lang9\par
